{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "c2671904cd9b04147063d38441537cf2c6a2b238e25bd6a43d90dcf57ed75796",
  "bundle_request_count": 16,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:0a31278576123cade1b6d3e3d333bacd18a1f124a7a2969e8e5679e2a6c79959",
      "request_id": "0a31278576123cade1b6d3e3d333bacd18a1f124a7a2969e8e5679e2a6c79959",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "82b656cfc980b80546848da7be583f11",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上半区，捷克对加拿大，意大利对韩国。下半区，英国对德国，奥地利对西班牙。意大利与捷克可能提前碰头，阿卡与兹维列夫所在的两队，也可能在半决赛相遇。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "734afbfc550dfa11b64e3801b97275b4fdcdce651a4aa3e45efd47abb9d1a228",
      "words_sha256": "77777309b376f072c244b48339ae92f98693d8772c0c35805c8bf98bb25f0df5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:23a9acaf7611c1e1a949c946ba109dc1133cf252b57a4d334528fc45c4b19295",
      "request_id": "23a9acaf7611c1e1a949c946ba109dc1133cf252b57a4d334528fc45c4b19295",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "128306e61b641221f0af8380239bb6be",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "比赛十一月二十四日开打，二十九日决出冠军。两场单打各胜一场，就由双打决胜。按规则，八强和半决赛二比零也不自动取消双打，决赛二比零不打。阵容核实至十一月二十三日，出场看赛前名单。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "43b9f26bda602b96422dfdd1091d6924bf8938168c615456f965478102e19bf3",
      "words_sha256": "81f51e77b822a7bbbfa27dfc55503e0b2954c19ea36b0676644ff4eec73f2131"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:37ba0664364fa8e02041d38859e36f1ecf725dc0e6e59abb84b416aa8eaab5dd",
      "request_id": "37ba0664364fa8e02041d38859e36f1ecf725dc0e6e59abb84b416aa8eaab5dd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8152a862a308a6965eedb4a555e9a5cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德国历史交锋六比五领先。我这一轮选择德国。兹维列夫是最显眼的单打支点，施特鲁夫也有戴杯经验，双打则有长期配合的组合。不过英国有费里和诺里，双打更不能轻看；这不是一张世界第一的名片就能解决的比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "169cb80015ff4145cf5a6d89612500b170642358f8c370d090634349886a42cc",
      "words_sha256": "b81c16379b90488083d30dc28e472a01abc1d5f45ff8b4e1e13f7af411c24fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:44c623dbbb52c37e1069f22c00a4ad09a90b4fad2caafaf6de5ceeab6f7b87f2",
      "request_id": "44c623dbbb52c37e1069f22c00a4ad09a90b4fad2caafaf6de5ceeab6f7b87f2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3d63abf25bb14a57b0cc6dfcb7dede2b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "为什么我反复提双打？英国的帕滕和斯库普斯基，分别随各自搭档拿走今年四站大满贯中的三冠。德国克拉维茨与皮茨这一组合，戴杯十八胜两负。两场单打各赢一场，双打就能把纸面判断推倒。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "be5837162137362c0aad43c61e0b87b9f6b2b679dea27cdeec0d1c08f3d6e7da",
      "words_sha256": "ff8eb8986a5e82cb6fbb6da1f40516668c4d44f7a64dc5fdb9170ae33acf5ee2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4d42b7248e27fe3a6ac75704a1bd4250eae40d9c2a4ba6c454fa187c95294f06",
      "request_id": "4d42b7248e27fe3a6ac75704a1bd4250eae40d9c2a4ba6c454fa187c95294f06",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "161699c355f7a5cc97ea84df10d48861",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "西班牙的福基纳也已因伤退出，梅里达补入，所以不能再按最初那份名单分析。阿卡、霍达尔之外，马丁内斯和格拉诺列尔斯提供双打选择。阵容有变化，但我仍把西班牙放在争冠第一档。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "26331f6d755604894cbb39ddabf0bbbb3bfc909265d5712bc08faed82fbb08a8",
      "words_sha256": "dc391b135eefbf2f78b48351f4e1924214a3187c78011e6e7b6e86e54cc1e454"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:64031a8d9c8b9c7283f8534d15e6d698616b516f120bac2587b2a1d3638d3a61",
      "request_id": "64031a8d9c8b9c7283f8534d15e6d698616b516f120bac2587b2a1d3638d3a61",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6f80a4ab5ba997f5a74e41f947dc71f0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "意大利已经把博莱利换成贝雷蒂尼，另外四人是科博利、穆塞蒂、达尔德里和瓦瓦索里。我仍选意大利，依据是主场、三连冠经验和单打选择。韩国首次进入八队淘汰阶段，权纯雨和郑泫有冲击力，但这轮对手更完整。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "10a11217acbdf04102b22c887b38f1b25c54f0074457755cd278ebd8619bae26",
      "words_sha256": "10e2d6a67dbab2356e7ee1a75c73c0edfffa1548a6206361356021fa5d8fc2f9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:65c570b076a66f0a8d02b4d216b6f1ef7267d2d945aa02444bc76605fc0a307a",
      "request_id": "65c570b076a66f0a8d02b4d216b6f1ef7267d2d945aa02444bc76605fc0a307a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2afe0ea0571e61c7b62dd1f0544840b7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "总交锋其实是奥地利三比二领先，但这是跨年代的国家队旧账，不能直接套到今年。西班牙有阿卡和霍达尔两位世界前十，我更看好他们的单打配置。奥地利今年赢过日本和比利时，也不是一张能直接略过的签。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "97cd331d7e3cef3c74bd98b61c5b5506d10d100a2315b26e72cc4998781e3adc",
      "words_sha256": "b2787ad58a4a9d12e3b645bfc863b72d395ea0a8faa400d22954d032d1e1340a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6d0004c3c487a8156a33c0efef9a2f3f82c70b7051fe7e4c0091642511fb658b",
      "request_id": "6d0004c3c487a8156a33c0efef9a2f3f82c70b7051fe7e4c0091642511fb658b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b5d77a879dbd25a17d2902f01b98f65f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "加拿大最大的变化，是沙波瓦洛夫和迪亚洛因伤退出，阿利亚西姆仍然领衔。这不等于加拿大没有机会；九月赢法国时，他们也不只靠一位球员。但两位原定主力缺席，会让我把票投给配置更完整的捷克。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "75a2a5fb985eb13daaf65e99a4965c165b8e5b33c0c89334f912333c21eff549",
      "words_sha256": "7760320b77f1ffae17515f9ae72aa934d01861ccfd3ccdff75df3bc73c4b87b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6fac788fd1421c5b4397945fa9ed880751cb8f6dbdd0d30c003c58a55a59a599",
      "request_id": "6fac788fd1421c5b4397945fa9ed880751cb8f6dbdd0d30c003c58a55a59a599",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "27648d75ffe8b48a55240d05a4be7c91",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "假如决赛是意大利对西班牙，我的冠军票投西班牙。意大利的三连冠与主场优势都很硬，但西班牙这次有阿卡，也有霍达尔提供第二个单打支点。我更愿意押他们在两场单打里争取结束比赛，而不是把希望全留给最后的双打。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "76e8408e5971c91bc2110d218d289f6b8c0a4cd047b9ae5a71f3d4210412c14e",
      "words_sha256": "30765a5c09a2b445bbba6e0191d96eea2a440de005acefedd6d20552b6c917b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9319ce38bfaa7006eb5b7b13b13e1082a8168178864b2050b3a1241d83ce4ded",
      "request_id": "9319ce38bfaa7006eb5b7b13b13e1082a8168178864b2050b3a1241d83ce4ded",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4f2b2dce91453238e0b03307f35c95ce",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿卡赢下都灵年终赛后，已确认前往博洛尼亚。兹维列夫脚踝不适影响了发球，但他说戴杯参赛并未受到威胁。我的预测仍要看两人的恢复，以及各队实际排兵布阵。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1912dbdc2c36976249ea9af8e8682a10a741284f0d4843bedf42b34d151e4091",
      "words_sha256": "40aec533af382357200b718fca60fd78df648ce939a2763229b73b9d533a2f3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9a0f7982cdf4e22cea9381f8f537c1241c07e1e93b9721fbf9258f7100b8fa40",
      "request_id": "9a0f7982cdf4e22cea9381f8f537c1241c07e1e93b9721fbf9258f7100b8fa40",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e6178a1dee0b9aadef21fbb93ec0dc22",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "我的四强选择，是意大利、捷克、德国和西班牙。接下来两场是假设这些球队晋级后的推演：上半区我选意大利，下半区更倾向西班牙。两场的理由并不一样。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2b3b9fe6d58eaa2a4e2aea546a5c5b103dccd168ba593f1aec54ebc1b6a98555",
      "words_sha256": "308d6b3044b4b8e6d9d608e32663fe87561d16d58d37e9ae010cb10e8ca00489"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b71def8514bafbe3cae9f01160174dd4880780d01dc8cfc97640e11e1511c4b2",
      "request_id": "b71def8514bafbe3cae9f01160174dd4880780d01dc8cfc97640e11e1511c4b2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "35db2f2da65909b6b34637b5a73a80c7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "德国对西班牙，是我最犹豫的一票。最后仍选西班牙，因为阿卡之外，霍达尔让另一个单打位置也有竞争力。德国要改写预测，关键可能在施特鲁夫这个点；一旦两队各拿一场单打，就不能再只比较阿卡和兹维列夫。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d3c330cde13fb31f7cabc00214dd73055fb0fe28b4fded997d5db70fc2408759",
      "words_sha256": "93e19425c4df52cff0327cfe66b9f5d81e42a510f958425e7a997b01f8458a6c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cdbdd1fff3a09c8e4f5381e2cbfec4ff41d7fe0e3257b4a3d120289f492be6f4",
      "request_id": "cdbdd1fff3a09c8e4f5381e2cbfec4ff41d7fe0e3257b4a3d120289f492be6f4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "eda3d24658623b414f7f4f3393c67b2b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后把答案放在一张图上：四强选意大利、捷克、德国和西班牙，决赛选意大利对西班牙，冠军先选西班牙。最需要防的变数是德国。戴维斯杯不是把单打排名相加，谁能稳定拿到第二分，谁才更接近银碗。你会把谁换进决赛？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7483ea7c67e13b80a4ac1c6d487a912fb54a8b3039c514cad8e370c47981ece6",
      "words_sha256": "5c9d102a96d400a7414ac4af6e9dc3da926efd46ee68040aac2c24b4d0b41404"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cf2322fc0fe22dd4cae03a6ee9559d1797f748e29a67941aaf82c2621e07b0d4",
      "request_id": "cf2322fc0fe22dd4cae03a6ee9559d1797f748e29a67941aaf82c2621e07b0d4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ba94130d6ac0385bae230fcbf76b906b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这两队在戴维斯杯还是第一次碰面。我更看好捷克，因为莱赫奇卡和门西克都是世界前二十，单打有两个可靠选择，马哈奇同样进入名单。我的判断看的是阵容厚度，不是某一位球员必胜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7b591e779bb2629cc4eb461eb01e008f9b89b2ab310b0a550038f6062953d7cd",
      "words_sha256": "f05619f44bd56d14e03119c794471da3487ca494bd4b2d51ab90e490007a6c8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f0fd16de242950563d01e39af463104ab2860b7ceecf992999669ebb557824c5",
      "request_id": "f0fd16de242950563d01e39af463104ab2860b7ceecf992999669ebb557824c5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e5aa6decc2ec04fdedc374979006ef20",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿卡和兹维列夫都来，戴维斯杯就成了两个人的对决吗？我先给结论，冠军倾向西班牙，最防德国改写下半区。理由要从每队怎样拿到第二分说起。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "dcbaa8daf0d506311b2e3cee656a815b2964c25eee7709e1d45d052494c4f125",
      "words_sha256": "55cda9fc03e51f3869b29f7a0c72a475f645bdf7b5474c869a5d4a0f641f7569"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fce3f0355d688c5faf383dd6d889587954d093391981559380b8e56de63b0a36",
      "request_id": "fce3f0355d688c5faf383dd6d889587954d093391981559380b8e56de63b0a36",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d093e56e3dc6ea0d5cd40b2787483840",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+12%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "意大利对捷克，我仍选意大利进决赛。捷克有两位前二十单打，这是实在的挑战。贝雷蒂尼补入后，意大利多了一位有戴杯经验的单打选择。但不能再把博莱利与瓦瓦索里的搭档当作优势，双打怎样排，要看临场名单。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "01267bbb6c45429b4a25ccde11977c268782a0c66b2efe7304ecd68ae858150b",
      "words_sha256": "4f7f1e11366ce6d6b08827be1f3f8114fc758a71e5ae7cd7980136ada88996d7"
    }
  ]
}
